    "op": "test",
    "path": "/worldTypeDescription/GasGiant/0",
    "value": "A giant ball of gases intermingling with one another. There is simply nothing here to land on."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/worldTypeDescription/GasGiant/1",
    "value": "A gas giant. There is no solid substance to this planet, just a collection of swirling gases."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/worldTypeDescription/GasGiant/2",
    "value": "Can't land. The crushing pressure and tearing winds of this gas giant would kill you instantly."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/garden/0",
    "value": "^#76fe68;Lush ^reset;foothills mark this landing location. Both flora and fauna are abundant here. A beam site of immeasurable safety."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/garden/1",
    "value": "The beam site is located in a tranquil area of great bio-diversity. There are resources here that you could use. A ^#76fe68;lush ^reset;and pleasant land."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/garden/2",
    "value": "Readings indicate the landing site is not unfavourable - the area is safe, and lavish with both flora and fauna. A ^#76fe68;lush ^reset;and hospitable place."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/forest/0",
    "value": "Densely colonized by trees and other flora, this ^#15ce02;forest ^reset;landing site is a hospitable location that supports a diversity of life - potentially including your own."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/forest/1",
    "value": "Leafy trees abound in this ^#15ce02;forest ^reset;location. The area is hospitable to life, my database indicates that you may encounter woodland creatures."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/forest/2",
    "value": "Your beam site for this planet is located in a ^#15ce02;forest^reset;. Readings indicate that this wooded area is relatively tranquil."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/desert/0",
    "value": "There is limited flora here on this ^#e6c801;desert^reset;, but the location does support life. ^red;Hot days, cool nights^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/desert/1",
    "value": "A ^#e6c801;desert^reset; area populated by cacti, as well as various animal life. A relatively safe landing site, so long as you avoid the sandstorms. ^red;Quite warm^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/desert/2",
    "value": "Sand. Readings indicate sand. Also some cacti... but predominantly sand. This ^#e6c801;desert^reset; is ^red;uncomfortably warm^reset; but rich in resources."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/snow/0",
    "value": "This chilly landing site is laden with ^#69f1fd;snow^reset;. Sundry trees grow here and various animals also thrive in the cold conditions. An excellent place to make snowballs."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/snow/1",
    "value": "The landing location is cold, but not perilously so. ^#69f1fd;Snow^reset; covers the area and blizzards are a possibility. A hat and gloves may be advisable."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/snow/2",
    "value": "This location is relatively chill, and ^#69f1fd;snow^reset; lies thickly on the ground. My sensors indicate that there are critters scampering through the soft blanket of white."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/savannah/0",
    "value": "The landing site is situated in an area of ^#ffe21d;dry grassland ^reset;that is hot and prone to dust storms. It is neither especially pleasant, nor especially dangerous."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/savannah/1",
    "value": "This area of ^#ffe21d;dry grassland ^reset;is sparsely populated by trees. It is not excessively inhospitable - readings indicate that there is a hare bouncing around."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/savannah/2",
    "value": "The landing location is located in an area of ^#ffe21d;dry grassland^reset;. Trees and shrubs grow sparsely in the heat. A dusty place of wide, flat vistas."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/ocean/0",
    "value": "A planet of deep ^#008aff;oceans^reset; and small islands. My readings indicate that aquatic life is abundant and that the islets of the surface are extremely picturesque."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/ocean/1",
    "value": "An ^#008aff;ocean^reset; covered planet spotted with islands and teeming with life. My readings indicate that there is a great deal of activity in the depths of the waters."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/ocean/2",
    "value": "Floating desert islands pepper the surface of this ^#008aff;ocean^reset; planet. An environment of tropical ambiance and aesthetic."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/toxic/0",
    "value": "This planet is ^#06ff00;toxic^reset; - the air is putrefied and the oceans are poisonous. ^red;Radiation levels are moderate^reset; and dense clouds of ^06ff00;poison^reset; cover the surface."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/toxic/1",
    "value": "This ^red;moderately radioactive^reset; planet is a poisonous wilderness inhabited by irradiated lifeforms. Its luminescent surface is ^#06ff00;toxic^reset; with dense ^red;poisonous air^reset;. "
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/toxic/2",
    "value": "This is a ^#06ff00;toxic^reset; planet replete with ^red;radiation and poisonous air^reset;. The noxious oceans are ^red;lethally poisonous^reset;. "
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/jungle/0",
    "value": "The landing site is in a dense, hot ^#12a003;jungle^reset;. A menagerie of astounding creatures live amongst the lush flora. It is a shame about the ^red;moderately high radiation^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/jungle/1",
    "value": "A ^#12a003;jungle^reset; landing site densely inhabited by flora and fauna of many kinds. The area is rich with resources but quite hot and ^red;moderately radioactive^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/jungle/2",
    "value": "^red;Moderate, unsafe levels of radiation^reset; render this ^#12a003;jungle^reset; location an extremely hostile environment and local fauna is similarly unwelcoming."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/alien/0",
    "value": "This is a somewhat risky landing site - ^red;radiation levels are moderately high^reset;. However, the ^#7800ff;mutated^reset; terrain could be described as darkly whimsical."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/alien/1",
    "value": "A landing site characterised by odd flora, aggressive fauna and ^red;moderately high levels of radiation^reset;. The area's inhabitants are severely ^#7800ff;mutated^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/alien/2",
    "value": "The beam location is situated in a ^#7800ff;mutated^reset; landscape. The ^red;moderate levels of radiation^reset; create a noxious environment. I advise you to avoid swimming."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/arctic/0",
    "value": "^red;Temperatures at the landing site are dangerously low.^reset; You will be beaming onto a small island surrounded by ^#00ffe4;frigid ocean^reset;. I strongly advise you to wear a scarf."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/arctic/1",
    "value": "The beam site is ^red;intensely cold^reset;: a tiny island in a ^#00ffe4;frigid ocean^reset;. There is a 0.025% chance you will mis-beam into the water, quickly succumbing to the awful chill."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/arctic/2",
    "value": "A site of ^red;dangerously low temperatures^reset;. There are few animals here, and no plant-life at all - just forsaken islands in a ^#00ffe4;frigid ocean^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tundra/0",
    "value": "A ^#61ffe3;frozen^reset; place, formed of ice - the permafrost runs deep here. Snow storms are common, and ^red;temperatures are dangerously low^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tundra/1",
    "value": "This ^red;dangerously cold.^reset; landing site is ^#61ffe3;frozen^reset; solid. High likelihood of accidental self-cryopreservation. Protect yourself from the cold."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tundra/2",
    "value": "^red;Temperatures at the beam site are dangerously low^reset;. The area is ^#61ffe3;frozen^reset;, and inhabited only by flora and fauna that are extremely resistant to the cold. "
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/volcanic/0",
    "value": "The ^#e11212;volcanic^reset; landing site is ^red;catastrophically hot^reset;. If you wish, I can calculate your likelihood of immediately bursting into flame upon beam down..."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/volcanic/1",
    "value": "^#e11212;Volcanic^reset; activity blights this planet and the beam site is in an area of particular virulence. The ^red;temperature is far beyond normally survivable levels^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/volcanic/2",
    "value": "The beam site is situated in ^#e11212;volcanic^reset; terrain and is ^red;exquisitely hot^reset;. Your interest in this place certainly displays your dauntless tenacity."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/midnight/0",
    "value": "This is a ^#e11212;dark^reset; world where the sun never rises. The surface is ^red;dangerously cold^reset;. You should prepare yourself both mentally and physically before landing here."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/midnight/1",
    "value": "This ^#e11212;dark^reset; world is ^red;perilously cold^reset;. Strange shadowy figures dwell here, hidden in the unremitting night."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/midnight/2",
    "value": "Scans show that the surface is ^#e11212;dark^reset;. In fact, scans show little else on account of all the darkness. However, I surmise that the surface is ^red;dangerously cold^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/scorchedcity/0",
