  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/superdense/2",
    "value": "A ^#914560;Super-dense^reset; world with a much higher gravitational force than other planets of the same size. ^red;Very dangerous. Tread carefully."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tabularasa/0",
    "value": "Some hideous catastrophe has resulted in this planet becoming a ^#59a849;Tabula Rasa^reset;. A doomsday virus? Maybe you can find out."
