  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tabularasa/1",
    "value": "Some hideous catastrophe has resulted in this planet becoming a ^#59a849;Tabula Rasa^reset;. A long-ago nuclear armageddon? Who knows?"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tabularasa/2",
    "value": "Some hideous catastrophe has resulted in this planet becoming a ^#59a849;Tabula Rasa^reset;. A Floran invasion? Who can tell?"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tarball/0",
    "value": "A ^#8349cc;tar ball^reset; with a semi-livable surface. Encumbering bodies of liquid with ^#555555;abundant oil^reset; litter the surface. ^cyan;Recommend: Heat protection^reset;"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tarball/1",
    "value": "A ^#8349cc;tar-covered world^reset; with breathable atmosphere. ^orange;Hazardous sticky pools of tar^reset; will make for slow travel. ^cyan;Recommend: Heat protection^reset;"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tarball/2",
    "value": "A ^#8349cc;tar ball^reset; with ^#555555;abundant oil sources^reset; detected on and below the surface. Some sort of ^orange;tar protection^reset; could prove useful. ^cyan;Recommend: Heat protection^reset;"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/thickjungle/0",
    "value": "^#8cf387;Rainforest^reset; has claimed the majority of this organic-rich world. Abundant ^#green;organic resources^reset; detected."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/thickjungle/1",
    "value": "A ^#8cf387;rainforest^reset; planet absolutely ripe with organic life. Abundant ^#green;organic resources^reset; detected."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/thickjungle/2",
    "value": "^#8cf387;Rainforest^reset; covers nearly the entire surface of this warm and inviting planet. ^green;Bamboo and other organic resources detected in large quantities.^reset;"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tidewater/0",
    "value": "This ^#008aff;tidewater^reset; world is subject to massive tidal forces. Ocean currents show fauna rich in ^orange;mutated nodules^reset; with interesting applications. ^cyan;Recommend: Poison protection^reset;"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tidewater/1",
    "value": "^#008aff;Tidal^reset; forces are extra strong on this ocean world. Unusual ^orange;rare resources^reset; detected on the ocean floor. ^cyan;Recommend: Poison protection^reset;"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tidewater/2",
    "value": "A ^#008aff;tidewater^reset; planet covered in sharp reefs, spike-like stone formations and ^orange;rare resources^reset;. ^cyan;Recommend: Poison protection^reset;"
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tundradark/0",
    "value": "A ^#61ffe3;frozen^reset; place, formed of ice - the permafrost runs deep here. Snow storms are common, and ^red;temperatures are dangerously low^reset;."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tundradark/1",
    "value": "This ^red;dangerously cold.^reset; landing site is ^#61ffe3;frozen^reset; solid. High likelihood of accidental self-cryopreservation. Protect yourself from the cold."
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/tundradark/2",
    "value": "^red;Temperatures at the beam site are dangerously low^reset;. The area is ^#61ffe3;frozen^reset;, and inhabited only by flora and fauna that are extremely resistant to the cold. "
  },
  {
    "op": "test",
    "path": "/visitableTypeDescription/urbanwasteland/0",
    "value": "A ^#848484;wasteland^reset; housing the remains of a once great civilization. Something awful happened here, long ago. ^#43a43a;Ancient ruins^reset; hold many lost treasures. ^red;Violent weather detected^reset;."
  },
  {
